      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-47429",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/74/7484bb419440c77b402d8ac83fce21bfec8b9c04796b5f0216a2b6eb700065d3.png)\n\nTwo ships are sailing from a port. The first ship sails due east and the second ship sails $30^{\u2218}$ south of east. After two hours, the captain of the first ship noticed that they are $100km$ from the second ship, and that the angle from the port to the second ship is $50^{\u2218}$. To the nearest kilometer, what is the current distance from the second ship to the port?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."
